  "description": {"zh-CN": "9 × 9 m 正负压可切换的隔离手术室，用于经空气/飞沫传播感染患者：只经缓冲间（local 西侧）进出，不与无菌核心区和走廊直接相通；房间压差监测仪在门旁显示负压，排风经高效过滤后排放。其余配置同一体化手术室。", "en": "9 × 9 m switchable-pressure isolation OR for patients with airborne or droplet-transmitted infection: entered only through its anteroom (local west), with no direct door to the sterile core or the corridor; a room pressure monitor by the door shows the negative differential and the exhaust is HEPA-filtered. Otherwise equipped as the integrated OR."},
